   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>Adds a small holographic scope, improving close-range accuracy.</em></p>\n<p>When making a Single Shot Attack on a target within 0-12m/yds, and while wielding the weapon in two hands, the user gains a +1 bonus to their Attack Check. For One-Handed Ranged Weapons, this does not cause the weapon to require two hands to be wielded, only that it requires such for the above attack bonus to apply. This does not stack with the bonus provided by the Glow Sights Weapon Mod.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Scopes &amp; Sights).</em></p>"
